cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite the versioned software release."
title: "Genuine Zero Uniform Atlas Energy"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Massensini
    given-names: Thiago
license: MIT
version: 0.17.0
date-released: 2026-08-20
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of the native real-camera/Genuine zero identity, the
  faithful C2--C7 cutoff operator, exact critical cutoff-tail jets, and the
  finite-to-limit transverse-energy architecture. Version 0.17.0 adds an
  analytic near-axis certificate for every critical Genuine zero of arbitrary
  positive finite multiplicity: each zero is isolated and admits a positive
  punctured horizontal nonvanishing radius. Combined with nonvanishing on the
  complementary strip region, the certificate yields final confinement. The
  complement certificate and unconditional global strip-wide theorem remain
  open and are not promoted by this release.
